        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2050_top_02",
      "hash64": "7B9F6301D9F9EBED",
      "text": "Aquí se han gestado entonces las cualidades que\\nte han permitido encumbrarte como Campe[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302)]ónona.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2050_top_03",
      "hash64": "7B9F6201D9F9EA3A",
      "text": "De todas formas, tampoco ha pasado mucho\\ntiempo desde que te mudaste a la residencia.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2050_top_04",
      "hash64": "7B9F5D01D9F9E1BB",
      "text": "Si no te parece inapropiado, me gustaría visitar\\ntambién tu casa en algún momento.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2050_top_05",
      "hash64": "7B9F5C01D9F9E008",
      "text": "Bueno, entremos en materia.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2050_top_06",
      "hash64": "7B9F5F01D9F9E521",
      "text": "Quiero que me digas cuáles son tus impresiones\\ntras haber visitado los ocho gimnasios.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2050_top_07",
      "hash64": "7B9F5E01D9F9E36E",
      "text": "En tu calidad de Campe[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302)]ónona, ¿a qué Líder de\\nGimnasio lograste derrotar con mayor facilidad?[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2050_top_08",
      "hash64": "7B9F5901D9F9DAEF",
      "text": "¿Quién te causó una mayor impresión?[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2050_top_09",
      "hash64": "7B9F5801D9F9D93C",
      "text": "¿Quién te lo puso más difícil en combate?[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2050_top_10",
      "hash64": "7B9BDB01D9F6CEFE",
      "text": "Y una última pregunta, quizá la más importante\\nde todas.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2050_top_11",
      "hash64": "7B9BDC01D9F6D0B1",
      "text": "¿Quién te gustó más?[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2050_top_12",
      "hash64": "7B9BD901D9F6CB98",
      "text": "Esas eran todas las preguntas que tenía.\\nMuchas gracias por responderlas.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2050_top_13",
      "hash64": "7B9BDA01D9F6CD4B",
      "text": "Es muy ilustrativo contar con el punto de vista\\nde un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0A08)] Campeóna Campeona, como te puedes imaginar.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0A08"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2050_top_14",
      "hash64": "7B9BDF01D9F6D5CA",
      "text": "Tendré en cuenta toda la información que me has\\ndado para asegurar el buen funcionamiento de la\\r\\nLiga Pokémon. Te lo agradezco encarecidamente.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
